locking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Miang Moonspell can be unlocked by evolving ",{"i":"Sprite-Festive_Winds.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:festive-winds"}," ",{"t":"Festive Winds","r":"weapon:festive-winds"}," into ",{"i":"Sprite-Argent_Flow.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:argent-flow"}," ",{"t":"Argent Flow","r":"weapon:argent-flow"}," and obtaining ",{"i":"Sprite-Pearl_magatama.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"passive:pearl-magatama"}," ",{"t":"Pearl magatama","r":"passive:pearl-magatama"}," at the same time as ",{"i":"Sprite-Miang_Moonspell.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:miang-moonspell"}," ",{"t":"Miang Moonspell","r":"character:miang-moonspell"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Miang Moonspell starts with +20 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +1.00 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", -20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", and +108 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Miang Moonspell retains all of Miang Moonspell's passive bonuses, such as her ability to multiply all sources of healing by Recovery."]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Miang Moonspell's Max Health equals her current health. Thus, any healing or overhealing will increase her Max Health by the same amount. However, receiving damage will also decrease her Max Health by the same amount."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Falling below 20% of Miang's base Max Health can still trigger Critical-HP skills."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Sources of percent-based healing, such as Pearl magatama and certain Survarot skills, create a positive feedback loop of healing and increasing Max Health to the point where Megalo Miang is able to reach the true limit of 3.402823E+38 health. With sources of damage that scale with health, Megalo Miang is able to hit the damage cap without the use of ",{"i":"Sprite-Golden_Egg.png","w":22,"h":24}," Golden Eggs."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Note that the heal from ",{"i":"Sprite-Sanctuary.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sanctuary"}," ",{"t":"Sanctuary","r":"weapon:sanctuary"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," will have no effect on Megalo Miang, as its coding prevents it from overhealing."]}]}},{"c":["Megalo Miang's passive synergizes well with ",{"i":"Sprite-Mazo_Familiar.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:mazo-familiar"}," ",{"t":"Mazo Familiar","r":"weapon:mazo-familiar"},", as her increasing Max Health will increase the damage and ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," of Mazo Familiar."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Aurablaster_Tip.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:aurablaster-tip"}," ",{"t":"Aurablaster Tip","r":"weapon:aurablaster-tip"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," does not synergize well with Megalo Miang due to its damage capping out at 1700 health."]},{"c":["Likewise, ",{"i":"Sprite-Divine_Bloodline_(IX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," is not recommended since it can't grant Megalo Miang any damage due to there never being any difference between her current and max health."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Miang_Moonspell.png","w":110,"h":120,"c":["Megalo Miang Moonspell's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Megalo_Miang_Moonspell.gif","w":107,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 August 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}